{"id":3171,"name":"Yama no Susume Third Season","slug":"yama_no_susume_third_season","synopsis":"The third season of *Yama no Susume*.\n\nAoi and Hinata are childhood friends. Aoi prefers staying indoors and is afraid of heights, whereas Hinata is outgoing and loves mountaineering. They both decide to climb a mountain in order to see a sunrise they saw together when they were younger.\n\nIn the coming third season, they enjoy hiking beautiful mountains with colored leaves and the story gets even more colorful when they become friends with local school girls!!\n\n(Source: Yomiuri TV Enterprise)","format":"TV_SHORT","season":"SUMMER","year":2018,"createdAt":"2021-03-27 00:44:49","updatedAt":"2021-03-28 09:31:31","resources":{"nodes":[{"site":"MAL","externalId":35672},{"site":"ANILIST","externalId":98866},{"site":"KITSU","externalId":13583},{"site":"ANIDB","externalId":13205},{"site":"ANN","externalId":20513},{"site":"ANIME_PLANET","externalId":8922},{"site":"X","externalId":null},{"site":"OFFICIAL_SITE","externalId":null}]},"images":{"nodes":[{"id":6327,"facet":"LARGE_COVER","path":"anime/large-cover/pdvKWVN89qzpZLkkb24AEQmrHOY7TV7FkWlhoIi5.jpg"},{"id":6328,"facet":"SMALL_COVER","path":"anime/small-cover/YNUcgnFbdIqLQponucoHIHykjnY6r3H3PadetokE.avif"}]},"studios":{"nodes":[{"id":24,"name":"8bit","slug":"8bit"}]},"series":{"nodes":[{"id":183,"name":"Yama no Susume","slug":"yama_no_susume"}]},"animethemes":[{"id":8285,"slug":"OP1","type":"OP","sequence":null,"song":{"id":8286,"title":"Chiheisen Stride","titleNative":null},"animethemeentries":[{"id":9684,"version":1,"episodes":null,"nsfw":false,"spoiler":false,"videos":{"nodes":[{"id":9707,"basename":"YamaNoSusumeS3-OP1-Lyrics.webm","filename":"YamaNoSusumeS3-OP1-Lyrics","link":"https://v.animethemes.moe/YamaNoSusumeS3-OP1-Lyrics.webm","mimetype":"video/webm","size":29215801,"resolution":720,"nc":false,"subbed":false,"lyrics":true,"overlap":"NONE","source":"WEB","tags":"Lyrics","audio":{"id":7706,"basename":"YamaNoSusume